===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|skate|board}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|En-us-skateboard.ogg|a=US}}

===Noun===
{{swp|lang=en}}
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|sports|recreation}} A narrow, wooden or plastic platform mounted on pairs of [[wheel]]s, on which one stands and propels oneself by pushing along the ground with one foot.
# {{lb|en|automotive}} A vehicle {{l|en|chassis}} format, used for electric vehicles, which holds the drive motors and power energy store (ie. batteries), forming the vehicular base.

